"Install <application>Xfce4 Power Manager</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Xfce4 Power Manager</application> executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xfce/core/xfce4-power-manager.xml:107
#, no-wrap, xml-text
